commit a2d585c758c27026ce4f906069272da177fa6c8d
Author: Gabe Castro <gabe@techworx.dev>
Date:   Wed Nov 18 10:44:45 2026 -0800

    fix(version): bind a resumed plan to this workspace's checkpoint tree

    A resume plans in a scratch checkout of the checkpoint, found by the workspace's path. When that path resolved to a sibling directory with the same packages and versions, every input check passed and the sibling's bump, notes and changelog were written here. `resume_input_changes` now refuses (E340) unless the scratch directory's tree in the checkpoint is this workspace's own.

    The fixture `GitRunner` supports a child environment so the real checkpoint path runs in graph tests.

    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M7QZKHCY30REKA6CTWXSKF0H

